[gd_scene format=3]

; The Reliquary, west of the Cistern (map offset (65, -4.5)): a quiet chapel, a dead end. A pilgrim shrine
; by the doorway; at the far end, in a shaft of light, the altar where the Mag-grip relic rests. A metal
; pillar under a metal slab invites a first climb right after the pickup (an optional ledge with glyphs).
; The way back out is the doorway east, then up the Cistern's metal flue: it needs the relic.

